flowchart LR
    Analyst[Fraud Analyst Dashboard] --> API[Case API on Cloud Run]
    Admin[Supervisor Admin Console] --> API
    PubEntry[POST /cases/demo/async] --> API
    API --> Gateway[Agent Gateway and Policy Layer]
    Gateway --> Registry[Agent Registry]
    Gateway --> Policy[Policy Engine]
    Gateway --> Planner[Case Manager Dynamic Planner]
    Gateway --> ADK[Google ADK Agent Definitions]
    Gateway --> Memory[Firestore or Append-only Memory Bank]
    Gateway --> Armor[Model Armor Guardrails]
    Gateway --> Audit[Hash-chained Audit Ledger]
    Gateway --> Veritas[Embedded Veritas Federation]
    Gateway --> PubSub[Pub/Sub Investigation Jobs]
    PubSub --> Worker[Authenticated Push Worker]
    Worker --> Planner
    Planner --> Triage[Triage Agent]
    Planner --> Network[Network Agent]
    Planner --> Evidence[Evidence Agent]
    Planner --> Compliance[Compliance Agent]
    Planner --> CaseManager[Case Manager Agent]
    Triage --> Gemini[Gemini 2.5 Flash via Vertex AI]
    Triage --> Veritas
    Network --> BigQuery[BigQuery Related Transactions]
    Network --> Graph[3D Network Graph and Campaign Detection]
    Evidence --> Firestore[Firestore or Cloud SQL]
    Compliance --> Policies[Internal Policy Store]
    CaseManager --> Approvals[Human Approval Queue]
    Approvals --> Feedback[Approve Deny or Request More Evidence]
    Feedback --> Planner
    CaseManager --> Reports[Dashboard Report]
    Audit --> Logging[Cloud Logging Trace Fields]
